Instructions to run the prototype:
1. Create a folder in your preferred directory and name it bhutan_app
2. Download all the required files from Google Drive and place them inside this folder a shown in the reference below:
            D:/
            └── Bhutan_App/
                ├── data/
                │   └── bhutan_runoff_hourly_data.csv
                ├── flood_risk_app.py
                └── trained_model.py

3. Open VSCode -> Open Folder -> Select the bhutan_app folder
4. Run trained_model.py (wait for the execution to complete)
5. Run flood_risk_app.py (wait for the execution to complete)
6. Go to Terminal (present in the top ribbon) -> New Terminal
7. Write this command in the terminal: streamlit run flood_risk_app.py
8. The streamlit app will now open in your browser


